From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:44:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Trabis: timesheet quick entry by week (pick week + weekdays,
 then edit single days)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Quick entry gets a week select (Mon–Sun weeks touching the month, "KW nn",
  plus "whole month") and weekday checkboxes (default Mon–Fri, Sat/Sun optional).
- Applies only to the chosen days, also across the month boundary; vacation,
  sick leave, Karenz and public holidays stay untouched; asks before overwriting.
- Single days stay editable in the list; last week/days choice is kept.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: step 4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
